  "title": "Dengue Vaccine Expansion and HIV Prevention Innovation",
  "summary": "Takeda aims to secure 100 million annual dengue vaccine doses in India with Bio E by 2029, while Dr. Reddy's has finalized a distribution deal with Takeda to launch the vaccine in India, marking the country's first successful dengue vaccine approval for both children and adults. India's innovative Ecosystem and Regulatory Enhancements expand its R&D and clinical trial initiatives, while a controversial vaccine trial in Guinea-Bissau moves forward, and Dr. Reddy's receives approval for Zytorvi in India.",
